# License signing material and the registry of issued licenses. These live outside the
# repository (~/.husonym/ee-signing by default); the patterns are a backstop against a
# stray copy landing here. The private key cannot be replaced and the registry holds
# customer names and live licenses.
*_ca.key
registry.json
ee_license

# Written by `infisical init` to bind this checkout to the project holding the signing key.
# Not a secret, but this repository is public and there is no reason to publish which
# Infisical workspace guards it. Run `infisical init` again on a new machine.
.infisical.json

